            "review_title": "Review at Back Fire Bar & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Nehal N\nNew Delhi, India7 contributions\n0\nPlease. Dont go here.\nDec 2019 • Couples\nDisappointing. We walked in at 830pm. Not one person speaking English. Not even a little bit. We ordered a pizza, a pesto pasta and a vegetarian salad. The salad came after 45 minutes and wasn't vegetarian. The pizza came after an hour. At 930 pm they told us that pesto sauce isn't available due to which they cant serve pasta. \n\nAfter over an hour, we were left waiting and famished. Sadly, by 10pm most other restaurants shut down so we did not have enough time left to go eat anywhere else either. \n\nIf you are an international tourist, definitely do not go there. Maybe fine for locals, but with so much lack of communication, not fit for I international visitors at all.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-12",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
