            "review_text": "Epic-Traveller\nRushden, United Kingdom4482 contributions\n1\nExcellent\nJul 2019 • Friends\nPricey but excellent. I think it’s owned by an American as they’re the only ones stupid enough to call a toilet a restroom.\n\nThe burger we had was very nice. The waiting staff were all pleasant and friendly. There was a small birthday party next to our table and they let off indoor fireworks! Great fun!\n\nIce cream desert was very nice!\nRead more\nWritten July 6, 2019",
