            "review_title": "Review at Back Fire Bar & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Greg S\nSan Francisco, California11 contributions\n1\nOutstanding new cafe in Ha Long City (Hon Gai)\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWe were sad when Brisa Coffee shut down earlier this year, but Back Fire opened up not too long after that happened...and they serve food! \nFriendly and professional staff and delicious food and drinks. We greatly appreciate their nonsmoking environment. Happy to be regular customers on our weekly trips to Ha Long city.\nThey've got a store on the first floor, cafe on the second, restaurant on the third, and bar on the fourth. We're only able to visit midday, so we've only been able to take advantage of the store and cafe (which serves the full food/drink menu) so far.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 19, 2018",
